          "plain_language_summary": "Across 32 New York City churches, a lay health advisor–delivered lifestyle program plus motivational interviewing achieved greater SBP reduction than an attention-control health education program at 6 months, illustrating how trusted community institutions can deliver scalable hypertension control interventions.",
