          "plain_language_summary": "In CARDIA ancillary participants with intensive salivary cortisol sampling, higher early life stress was associated with higher wake-up cortisol and a flatter cortisol awakening response. Caregiver warmth showed the opposite association with the awakening response, and adult social support attenuated early-life stress associations in adjusted models.",
