      "specialty_areas": "SMS / behavioral economics / cardiovascular disparities / health equity / hypertension",
      "lab_synopsis": "As an NYU Langone internal medicine physician, I provide comprehensive care for adults, which includes preventive and wellness visits and treatment for both acute and chronic complex medical conditions.  My approach is grounded in an integrated care model. I collaborate closely with specialists to ensure my patients receive the most up-to-date and evidence-based care.  In my practice, I focus on the benefits of lifestyle interventions, such as sleep, exercise, and nutrition, to address many common chronic illnesses. I aim to empower my patients to take control of their health and wellbeing, to ensure a comprehensive and holistic approach to their care. Together we can work toward long-term positive outcomes and improved quality of life.  When not caring for patients, I am involved in cutting-edge research focused on developing and implementing high-impact health information technology and clinical decision support tools. My dedication to improving healthcare delivery and patient care through digital health innovations has been recognized by Business Insider, which honored me as one of its 30 leaders under 40 transforming the healthcare landscape.",
